# Line endings for the ML sidecar submodule.
#
# WHY THIS FILE EXISTS AT ALL: the superproject is edited from Windows and built on
# Linux. A CRLF shebang gives the container `bash\r: No such file or directory`, and a
# CRLF Python file turns a docstring into a syntax error in the most confusing way
# possible. The repository rule (AGENTS.md) is LF everywhere for text, enforced here so
# a checkout of THIS submodule behaves the same as one of the superproject.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Shell and container files must be LF even where a user sets core.autocrlf=true,
# because the kernel executes them rather than a tool that normalises them.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.dockerignore text eol=lf

# Binary artifacts: never diff, never normalise. Model weights are not tracked (see
# .gitignore) but a committed binary of any kind must not be rewritten by a checkout.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
